  "post_title": "Manuel Ruiz Ramos gana 2000 euros para gastar en tiendas de Onda Centre Comercial",
  "post_date": "2015-01-12 21:54:38",
  "post_name": "manuel-ruiz-ramos-gana-2000-euros-para-gastar-en-tiendas-de-onda-centre-comercial",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>Manuel Ruiz Ramos ha ganado los 2000 euros del primer premio del sorteo de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial (OCC) para gastar en tiendas que pertenecen a esta entidad. Sell&oacute; su papeleta en Tamayo Imatge, de la calle Isidoro Peris.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0054.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El sorteo se ha efectuado la noche de este lunes en la sala Col&oacute;n del Local de Asociaciones, en presencia del presidente de OCC, Jos&eacute; Ernesto Talamantes Mar&iacute;n. Ha le&iacute;do las bases y ha conducido el acto el secretario adjunto, Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n Cameselle.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0071.jpg\" style=\"height: 631px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n se han sorteado veinte premios m&aacute;s de 200 euros cada uno, que se pueden ver el listado de la foto de arriba, escrito sobre la marcha por el presidente. La mano inocente que ha extra&iacute;do las papeletas, m&aacute;s&nbsp;6 de reserva que se han guardado en sobres cerrados y firmados, ha sido la de &Aacute;lex Talamantes Chaparro.</p>\n<p>Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n le ha comunicado desde all&iacute; por tel&eacute;fono m&oacute;vil a Manuel Ruiz Ramos su premio y le ha emplazado para la entrega de las tarjetas regalo, el pr&oacute;ximo jueves, 15 de enero, a las 20.30 horas, en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la primera planta del Centro de Empleo y Cultura, en la calle Balmes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0039.jpg\" alt=\"img_0039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0040.jpg\" alt=\"img_0040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0042.jpg\" alt=\"img_0042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0044.jpg\" alt=\"img_0044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0045.jpg\" alt=\"img_0045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0049.jpg\" alt=\"img_0049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0050.jpg\" alt=\"img_0050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0054.jpg\" alt=\"img_0054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0055.jpg\" alt=\"img_0055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0056.jpg\" alt=\"img_0056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0058.jpg\" alt=\"img_0058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0059.jpg\" alt=\"img_0059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0060.jpg\" alt=\"img_0060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0061.jpg\" alt=\"img_0061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0063.jpg\" alt=\"img_0063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0064.jpg\" alt=\"img_0064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0065.jpg\" alt=\"img_0065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0066.jpg\" alt=\"img_0066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0067.jpg\" alt=\"img_0067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0069.jpg\" alt=\"img_0069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc15/img_0071.jpg\" alt=\"img_0071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
